           'OPTIONS AND ARGUMENTS\n'
           '    --root ROOT — Explicit fleet direct home.\n'
           '    --source SOURCE — required; Explicit Floati source checkout.\n'
           '    --ref REF — default="origin/main"; Named deployment currency ref.\n'
           '    --gateway-config PATH — Local stdio gateway v0 config; no discovery.\n'
           '    --profile PROFILE — Ruled profile (bus-only, orchestration), never inferred; '
           'bus-only expects live directories to be absent.\n'
           '    --no-sandbox — default=false; Skip the default sandbox write-set checks. There is '
           'no enabling flag because checks are on by default.\n'
           '    --probe — default=false; Send a loopback envelope to every registered node and '
           'verify each drains it within the budget (appends probe mail; per-node PASS/DEAF).\n'
           '    --probe-budget SECONDS — number; default=60.0; Probe drain budget in seconds per '
           'node.\n'
           '    --destination DESTINATION — Installed bundle for the installer-shadow observation; '
           'defaults to the FLOATI_INSTALL_DESTINATION environment variable when unset.\n'
           '    --codex-hooks PATH — Exact Codex hooks.json path for per-hook trust measurement.\n'
           '    --codex-config PATH — Exact Codex config.toml path containing hook trust state.\n'
           '    --json — default=false; Preserve the machine artifact in an interactive terminal.\n'
           '\n'
           'OPERATION NOTES\n'
           '    The installer-shadow check reads PATH as supplied; a PATH that omits the install '
           'scripts directory yields launcher_not_on_path; an unreadable entry yields '
           'path_entry_unreadable. Both name the coordinate and remedy; partial scans never claim '
           'no-shadowing.\n'
